  "details": "Selfie Expression head look and hands effect pickups and Udon using GetTrackingData Head.\n\nThis effects pickups when the user holds their hand up to the camera while holding a pickup. Things like a gun won't work very well when hands are active.\n\nWorlds using custom UI or teleporting based on Head tracking data provided to Udon are pivoted and rotated based on the avatar's head rather than the main camera.",
